OL,4,CTrading card shop loses #6k stock      
OL,5,Cafter break-in                         
OL,6,GThe owner of a trading card shop said  
OL,7,Gabout #6,000 worth of stock was stolen 
OL,8,Gor damaged during a break-in.          
OL,10,FDan Fitchew opened the Card Tavern in  
OL,11,FStone, Staffordshire, four years ago   
OL,12,Fto turn his lifelong passion for card  
OL,13,Fgames into a business.                 
OL,15,FHe believes the burglary happened at   
OL,16,Fabout 23:15 GMT on Saturday, after     
OL,17,Fwitnesses reported seeing men loading  
OL,18,Fstock into a car and alerted police.   
OL,20,F"It's naff when you've built up your   
OL,21,Fbusiness and someone takes all your    
OL,22,Fprofits," he said.                G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
